{"sections":[{"slug":"超Kähler流形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"超Kähler流形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">超</span> Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“超 Kähler 流形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">超</span> Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/K3曲面","text":"K3 <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的高维推广</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $(M,g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $4n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和乐","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和乐</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">属于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/辛群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">辛群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Sp}(n)$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为超</span> Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">超</span> Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形的切丛上有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/四元数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">四元数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的作用</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即切空间同构于</span> $\\mathbb H^n$), <span lang=\"zh\">且这种作用是平行的</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $TM$ <span lang=\"zh\">的三个自同态</span> $I,J,K$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $I^2 = J^2 = K^2 = IJK = -1$, $\\nabla I = \\nabla J = \\nabla K = 0$ ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Levi-Civita联络","text":"Levi-Civita <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":"). <span lang=\"zh\">另外</span>, $I,J,K$ <span lang=\"zh\">中每个都给出了</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上可积的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/近复结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">近复结构</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb H^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">很明显是超</span> Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>.</p>\n<p>Calabi <span lang=\"zh\">证明了</span> $T^* \\mathbb{C}P^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">上存在一个度量使得它成为超</span> Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>.</p>\n<p>$4$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Calabi--丘流形","text":"Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是超</span> Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $SU(2) \\simeq \\operatorname{Sp}(1) \\simeq \\operatorname{Spin}(3)$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}